---
import AppScreen from './AppScreen.astro';
import { screenshots } from '../data/screenshots';
---
<div class="published-preview"><div class="published-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">INSIDE THE VENDBI MOBILE APP</p><h3>Your operation, on screen.</h3></div><span class="published-label">PUBLISHED APP SCREENSHOTS</span></div><p class="published-intro">Explore dashboard, stock, machine and reporting views from the official VendBI app listings. Select a screen to visit its official app listing.</p><div class="app-screenshot-track" role="region" aria-label="VendBI app screenshot gallery, scroll to explore" tabindex="0">{screenshots.map(shot=><figure><a href={shot.listing} aria-label={`See ${shot.title} in the official ${shot.source} listing`}><AppScreen id={shot.id}/></a><figcaption><strong>{shot.title}</strong><a href={shot.listing}>Published on {shot.source} ↗</a></figcaption></figure>)}</div><p class="preview-caption">Interface views from VendBI’s app listings, with promotional headings cropped from the website presentation. Displayed figures are listing examples, not customer results. Available functions depend on your machine setup and software version.</p></div>
